{"3936190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Freshly Folded: Laundry Shop", "steam_appid": 3936190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! ✨</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/e9e2caff7ed835d6a0618a4800372a28.avif?t=1787722994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras_big/e9e2caff7ed835d6a0618a4800372a28.webp?t=1787722994 width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to <strong>Freshly Folded: Laundry Shop</strong> – your cozy ticket to running the most charming dry cleaning shop in town!<br><br>In a quiet, picturesque small town, the scent of fresh laundry drifts through the air. Here, your days are filled with the gentle hum of machines, the satisfying snap of pressed collars, and the smiling faces of customers who trust you with their treasured garments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/c3bf8300b62165188d46d8c44396c1d2.poster.avif?t=1787722994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/c3bf8300b62165188d46d8c44396c1d2.webm?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/c3bf8300b62165188d46d8c44396c1d2.mp4?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧺 Wash, Dry, and Press to Perfection</h2>  <br>Take on customer orders big and small – from delicate dresses to heavy coats – and treat each item with care. Operate your machines to <strong>wash, dry, and press</strong> clothes until they’re spotless and crisp.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👗 Serve Quirky Customers</h2>  <br>Meet a colorful cast of locals, each with their own laundry habits and unique requests. Some are picky about their pleats, others just want their lucky sweater cleaned before game day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/2b370aa3d81b0a1bf50ea13abc234c88.poster.avif?t=1787722994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/2b370aa3d81b0a1bf50ea13abc234c88.webm?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/2b370aa3d81b0a1bf50ea13abc234c88.mp4?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙ Upgrade Your Laundromat</h2>  <br>Start small and grow your business. <strong>Purchase new machines</strong> that clean faster, add <strong>efficiency upgrades</strong>, and create a layout that keeps your workflow smooth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪡 Master Minigames</h2>  <br>When the stains get stubborn or the seams split, jump into quick and satisfying minigames:  <br>• Mend ripped clothing  <br>• Remove tricky stains  <br>• Restore fabrics to their best condition<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/befee54aca76a416018a3ef4722c1a2f.poster.avif?t=1787722994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/befee54aca76a416018a3ef4722c1a2f.webm?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/befee54aca76a416018a3ef4722c1a2f.mp4?t=1787722994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Stay Organized</h2>  <br>Keep track of every order, match the right clothes to the right customer, and make sure nothing gets lost in the shuffle. The better your service, the more your reputation will grow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Features</h2>  <br>• Cozy small-town setting with relaxing vibes  <br>• Washing, drying, pressing, and mending gameplay  <br>• Colorful, quirky customers with fun personalities  <br>• Machine upgrades for faster, better service  <br>• Engaging cleaning and repair minigames  <br>• A charming, wholesome experience perfect for unwinding  <br><br><i>Whether you’re a stickler for spotless shirts or just love the satisfying rhythm of a well-run shop, <strong> Freshly Folded: Laundry Shop</strong> is your chance to press your way to perfection! - <strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/e9e2caff7ed835d6a0618a4800372a28.avif?t=1787722994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras_big/e9e2caff7ed835d6a0618a4800372a28.webp?t=1787722994 width=1560 height=460 /></span>", "about_the_game": "Welcome to <strong>Freshly Folded: Laundry Shop</strong> – your cozy ticket to running the most charming dry cleaning shop in town!<br><br>In a quiet, picturesque small town, the scent of fresh laundry drifts through the air. Here, your days are filled with the gentle hum of machines, the satisfying snap of pressed collars, and the smiling faces of customers who trust you with their treasured garments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/c3bf8300b62165188d46d8c44396c1d2.poster.avif?t=1787722994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936190/extras/c3bf8300b62165188d46d8c44396c1d2.webm?t=1787722994\" type=\"vid